{"metadata":{"description":"Verifiable narrative state, continuity and character-knowledge ledger for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1333699611","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-narrative-ledger","slug":"dongsheng123132/dsh-narrative-ledger","topics":["ai-agent","continuity","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","mcp","mcp-server","narrative","narrative-continuity","story-state"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Verifiable narrative state, continuity and character-knowledge ledger for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Narrative Ledger"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Maintainer / Author：He Fangsheng (贺方升 / 贺去病; also known as Dosen) · hequbing.com**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A read-only, verifiable story-state ledger for DeepSeek Harness. It is not a novel generator or writ"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ing-prompt wrapper. Existing tools such as Novel Director and InkOS manage writing workflows and ric"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"h story state; this plugin is the complementary evidence layer for machine-checkable continuity."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What it verifies"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- content-addressed external canon sources without copying manuscript prose into reports;
- contiguo"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"us immutable event sequence and monotonic story time;
- explicit fact assertion and retraction with "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"resolvable subject, predicate, value and source IDs;
- single-value contradictions such as two simul"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"taneous locations or mutually exclusive states;
- character knowledge acquired only by witnessing an"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" assertion or participating in a scene that communicates an active fact;
- spoiler-safe projection a"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"t a sequence number, returning only fact IDs and knowledge IDs;
- stale/missing canon, inactive fact"},{"id":"p6s7","text":" communication and invalid retraction disclosure;
- deterministic content-addressed JSON reports wit"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"h atomic publication and SHA-256 read-back."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The ledger rejects prose-, chapter-, draft-, prompt- and secret-shaped fields. Paths must remain ins"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ide `workspaceRoot`; symlinks are rejected. It runs no shell and makes no network requests. Only an "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"explicit `artifactDir` may be written."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"DSH tools: `dsh_narrative_ledger_inspect`, `dsh_narrative_ledger_verify`, `dsh_narrative_ledger_quer"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" tools: `dsh_narrative_ledger_inspect`, `dsh_narrative_ledger_verify`, `dsh_narrative_ledger_query`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The Codex plugin also exposes a proof-only stdio MCP server through `.mcp.json`: `narrative_ledger_i"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"nspect_inline`, `narrative_ledger_verify_inline`, and `narrative_ledger_query_inline`. MCP accepts b"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ounded inline manifest/event strings only, never paths, and performs no filesystem, network, process"},{"id":"p11s4","text":", or artifact writes. Because canon source bytes are not supplied, inline verification reports `veri"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"fied-structure` plus `sourceBytesVerified: false`; only DSH/CLI filesystem verification may report t"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"he canon sources as fully verified."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Version 0.2.0 uses a host-neutral namespace entry with no private DSH runtime dependency or default "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"export, so the stock Cordis Web loader can compose it safely. DSH and CLI remain the explicit filesy"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"stem surfaces; their content-addressed artifact response includes byte length and successful read-ba"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"heir content-addressed artifact response includes byte length and successful read-back verification."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## CLI"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"See `examples/basic`: Bob does not know the key-location fact at sequence 2 and learns it only in th"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"e disclosure scene at sequence 3."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}
